# Run Apply-Sigma.ps1 (and preferably Apply-SigmaFix.ps1) first.
# The patches are embedded, so there is nothing else to download.
#
# Usage:  pwsh -File .\Apply-SigmaDocs.ps1
#         pwsh -File .\Apply-SigmaDocs.ps1 -Kai D:\code\CppKAI

